{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_05_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_05",
  "title": "8:31P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "92cec988dfab90203fee7701199628ccb6a186f90c60aca8b35d088aa56a5a81",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "8:52 P.M.  天氣/多雲\n龍門貧民窟"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖！想活命就告訴我們，鼠王到底在哪兒！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我不知道啊！什麼鼠王......真的沒聽說過啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敬酒不吃吃罰酒——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，卡彭先生說過不要隨便對平民動手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種下三濫的貨色能算市民嗎？遮遮掩掩的，說不定就是個感染者垃圾！還敢裝糊塗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等、等等！別打了！我真的不知道啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘴硬！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——呃，嘔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，別管這傢伙了，噁心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看名單，下一個老東西似乎就住在這裡不遠，是個賣魚丸的，就在生鮮賣場對面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁，浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕，哈啊——骨頭都斷了，這幫——該死的——下手真重，嘎哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "必須得......告訴他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊的，站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "......你們有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（等等，注意旁邊那個男的，我總覺得這傢伙不好惹。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（龍門當地的幫派？不用擔心，按照卡彭先生的報告，都是小角色。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有點事情要問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰也不想惹上麻煩，對吧？乖乖回答我們，我們就走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......你的拳頭上有血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不好意思，只是些不配合的垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是像你們這樣的好市民，當然會配合我們的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "這是威脅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家心裡清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "那我拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......拒絕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姑娘，你好像弄錯了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，你也想變成那邊巷子裡的垃圾，被打得半死不活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "槐琥，我剛才聽到的慘叫聲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "——你們剛才說了，“垃圾”，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "以防萬一我多問一句，你是指這裡的居民嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒那麼多時間陪你廢話，趕緊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敢、敢還手！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都給我上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "下一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "不，算了，反正你們也就只是一群不入流的嘍囉，一起上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "古往今來，邪不勝正，你們這些濫傷無辜的下九流，何足掛齒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼情況！？這女人的動作——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就嘗嘗弩彈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......慢著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕！鬆手！你這混帳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "唉，你這種人，屬於冰箱斷電餿了三天的海膽，差不多那個感覺吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......算了，我不該學槐琥咬文嚼字的，還是直接點好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好大的勁，等！等等！要斷了！要斷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "把武器放下，滾出這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我知道了，你先放手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......但果然還是應該弄脫臼比較好吧。畢竟你拿著那麼危險的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃啊！你，你真下的了手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這、這兩個人怎麼回事？我沒聽說這附近有什麼注意目標啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁，先走，回頭再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管你們是哪個幫派的，都不會有好下場的！該死的龍門人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "不，都說了我不是黑社會，為什麼都喜歡以貌取人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "先別管這些，救人要緊，我去那邊看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "啊，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "——別動，我來幫你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿孑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "還好，都是皮外傷，別急，我這就去叫醫生，他們離這不遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿孑！別管我，先去找你董阿伯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們下一個目標就是他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
